# Anchored to the repo root: this is vitest's coverage-report output
# (pnpm test:coverage), the only place it's ever written (see
# vitest.config.ts — no reportsDirectory override, no per-package
# configs). An unanchored coverage/ would also swallow
# packages/cli/{src,test}/coverage/, which are source directories for
# the ATLAS taxonomy denominator, not report output.
/coverage/
